      "inputTokens": 119,
      "outputTokens": 960,
      "costUsd": 0.0086995,
      "pronunciationText": "So after n months, you owe thirty thousand times one point zero zero six to the n, minus six hundred times ay sum: one, plus one point zero zero six, plus one point zero zero six squared, up to the power n minus one. It's a geometric series with first term one, ratio one point zero zero six, and n terms. Its sum is one point zero zero six to the n, minus one, all over one point zero zero six minus one, which is zero point zero zero six. Notice the ratio is one plus r, not r itself."
    },
